  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to follow up and monitor the Bonn II decisions and commitments closely through engaging the CSOs within the planning and implementation processes, developed and undertaken by the Afghan government. It also facilitates a nationwide and inclusive process of consultation with CSOs&#xbf; actors and representatives to enhance people&#xbf;s participation and create national ownership of the processes.</narrative>
